msgstr "从此电脑移除账户…"

#: ui/app.slint:1629
msgid "Sync everything"
msgstr "同步所有内容"

#: ui/app.slint:1636
msgid ""
"Every folder in this account is kept on this computer. Untick to choose "
"specific folders."
msgstr "此账户中的每个文件夹都会保留在这台电脑上。取消勾选可选择特定文件夹。"

#: ui/app.slint:1636
msgid ""
"Only the ticked folders (and everything inside them) are kept on this "
"computer."
msgstr "仅勾选的文件夹及其全部内容会保留在这台电脑上。"

#: ui/app.slint:1639
msgid "Also sync files that sit at the top level (outside any folder)"
msgstr "也同步位于顶层（不在任何文件夹中）的文件"

#: ui/app.slint:1657
