msgstr "用于安装构建工具和 OneDrive 客户端"

msgid ""
"{}\n"
"\n"
"Why your password? Installing software changes the whole computer, not just "
"your account, so your computer checks that it's really you. You type it into "
"your computer's own password window, not into this app. Your computer checks "
"it once and then forgets it: it isn't saved, and this app never sees it or "
"sends it anywhere. It's only used {}. Nothing else is changed."
